Hlarf is the bluish-skinned half-giant who speaks for the [[Org/Roundhat Gang/index|Roundhat Gang]] to outsiders. He stands a head taller than the men around him and holds court at a table in the gang's back room at [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/The Crowded Flea|The Crowded Flea]]. He was the one who told Johnny that if [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Tywelwyn Leatherhide|Tywelwyn]] found him interesting he might meet him the next evening on [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/Pier 54|Pier 54]]. He fights with his fists, and one punch is enough to put a person on the ground.

Hlarf and the gang's other members are werecreatures; the ones the Party saw in the back room turned into boars, rats and a crocodile. When the Party appeared in the room by magic one night, Hlarf was there, and he helped finish them. Three of the Party died in the room and the fourth fled out the window.

After the killing, the gang took the dead party members' belonging's and the group's company car, the day tripper, along with Johnny's glasses (which Anzu was carrying), his chess piece, Benny's tool, a set of grappling guns, a glass cutter and a little money. They stripped Johnny, Benny and Argyle and dumped them in the river, and Johnny and Benny woke in the water, alive again.
